  choicesPanel1: {fileID: 1464167291}
  choicesPanel2: {fileID: 1620317630}
  choicesPanel3: {fileID: 196238648}
  choicesPanel4: {fileID: 944996270}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1679644639}
  nameInputPanel: {fileID: 164424770}
  backgroundAfternoonPanel: {fileID: 1679644640}
  backgroundAfternoonImage: {fileID: -9154537282285874706, guid: 29b13f96baea22941ad8d075513e21af, type: 3}
  backgroundNightPanel: {fileID: 1679644640}
  backgroundNightImage: {fileID: -6414785134311008807, guid: 155b20041e369bf47af4ed591cf94ad8, type: 3}
  dialogueBoxPanel: {fileID: 316939415}
  croissantDialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 160781248}
  playerDialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 1084255974}
  characterPanel: {fileID: 702462814}
  characterIdleImage: {fileID: 1277440773}
  characterHappyImage: {fileID: 276583986}
  characterSadImage: {fileID: 253908311}
  characterAngryImage: {fileID: 2088203382}
  characterFlirtyImage: {fileID: 1171997522}
  heart: 0
  maxHeart: 10
  slider: {fileID: 718472048}
  MaleBGM: {fileID: 0}
  MaleGroan: {fileID: 1639528473}
  MaleGiggle: {fileID: 143986261}
  MaleGasp: {fileID: 904262434}
  MaleFlirt: {fileID: 1701068952}
  sentences:
  - 'Player: What the...? '
  - 'Ah... Bonjour. You''ve caught me off guard. So you wish to eat me? '
  - 'Player: Why is a croissant talking to me right now? '
  - 'Pardon? I''m not just a croissant. I''m a chocolate one.  '
  - 'Excuse my manners, your name is? '
  - Name...
  - 'Ah...I see. A Tourist. '
  - '*silence*...'
  - Uhm...monsieur?
  - 'Oh right! It is...nice to meet you {Name}. I am Monsieur Chocolat. '
  - 'I apologize for my lack of conversation, but I don''t usually speak to... tourists.  '
  - '*Monsieur''s eyebrow raises* You''d be surprised how fleeting that beauty can
    be. '
  - 'I see you''ve equipped yourself with the local dialect...interesting. '
  - '{Name}: When in Rome, do as the romans do, and when in Paris...?  '
  - '...do as the Parisians do. '
  - ' Well, if all you''re here to do is eat me without getting to know me... '
  - '...then I was right about you tourists. All the same, all entitled. '
  - '{Name}: Excuse me? At least give me a proper chance before you judge me. '
  - '*sigh* Then prove why you are otherwise. '
  - 'I only talk when it''s necessary. '
  - Let's both try overcome this...obstacle.
  - '*thinking out loud* What do people usually talk about on a date? '
  - '{Name}: How about you ask me a question monsieur? '
  - 'Oh yes... Since you picked me (player name), what''s your favourite kind of
    croissant? '
  - 'How plain of you... *he waits for you to laugh* '
  - You see, I'm not much comedian.
  - '{Name}: I appreciate the attempt monsieur.   '
  - '*monsieur blushes* Bon!'
  - Chocolate goes with everything non?
  - Oui monsieur! How could I resist?
  - 'That''s awkward...  '
  - 'Who am I too judge your taste? I''ve too once fallen for the sweet and tart
    raspberry. '
  - '{Name}: A lover perhaps?'
  - 'Non... ex-lover. '
  - '{Name}:  Is this a touchy subject? You seem rather dejected.  '
  - 'Oui, I prefer not to talk about it. If you''re so curious, go get the full story
    from her. '
  - '{Name}: Who is she? '
  - '{Name}: The cupcake that was next to me, on the isle to my right. Dame Framboje. '
  - '{Name}: Noted. My turn to ask a question.  '
  - 'Merde! Why are you bring this up again? Me and her are through. '
  - '{Name}: I was just curious. '
  - 'Well curiosity kills the cat, and in this case you are the cat. '
  - '{Name}: My apologies monsieur. '
  - Hmmm...
  - Quiet, Kind and Handsome.
  - '{Name}: You can add decadent to that list. *player winks* '
  - 'Oh amor, you flatter me. A tourist and a sweet talker, what a package.  '
  - 'Of tourists? No '
  - 'Of you on the other hand. Oui.  '
  - "I see now that not all tourists are entitled la b\xEAtes. You're a nice b\xEAte.  "
  - "{Name}: B\xEAtes?  "
  - 'Ah...how do i say uh? '
  - 'Beasts, like animals. '
  - '{Name}: That''s not very nice monsieur.   '
  - "I mean some b\xEAtes are cute. Like you. "
  - '{Name}: Look monsieur it''s been lovely talking to you, but you see I came here
    to eat.   '
  - And eat you shall {Name}, but I have one last question for you.
  - 'Tell me {Name} why should I let you eat me? '
  - 'You''ve melted my heart amor. Do you promise to enjoy me to the fullest?  '
  - '{Name}: I promise. '
  - 'Bon! {Name} sink your teeth into me.  '
  - 'Merde! You tourists and your entitlement! '
  - 'I can''t believe I for a second thought you''d be different. '
